Crack it and the signal dies — a fact that makes the [[Sentience Distributor]] as much a liability as an asset. The enchantment woven into the device broadcasts a faint arcane pulse outward, spreading whatever sentience-laden signal it carries to whatever — or whoever — is listening. Handlers transport it in padded wards, never by hand if they can help it.
